    "author": "[#5aaabd[]]Plooey :3\n\n[gray[]]Contributors:\n[#b020b0[]]Cupcake[[gray]]: a lot of everything\n[#b02020[]]Tinport[gray[]]: sprites\n[#80b020[]]Lesley[gray[]]: sprites\n[#309090[]]Kennysetiawan[gray[]]: bundles\n[#b0b090[]]Kostolom[gray[]]: a huge amount of fx work and improvements to the units",
    "description": "[#5aaabd[]]Adds 2 planets with a shared campaign. (only one of them has been finished) \n[#5aaabd[]]The campaign focuses on liquid processing and logistics a lot, with a heavy bias towards payload transportation.\n[#5aaabd[]]This is also amplified by the fact that the factories in this mod are quite hard to supply, which hopefuly does result in a rather neat experience.\n\n[gray[]]This is a small ted project of mine. \n[gray[]]Im not aiming for anything big, and simply making something i enjoy and hope others will too.\n[gray[]]Have fun :3c\n",
